{"agent":"apply-decisions","data":{"alternatives":"","consequences":"","context":"","decided_by":"operator","decision":"Operator 2026-11-11 accepts D-phase-needs-scope-2026-11-11 with this answer: phase needs apply at the phase level only unless a task opts in. needs_apply defaults to 'phase' (the phase itself cannot start or close until its needs are done; its tasks do not inherit). A phase or a task opts into inheritance with an explicit inherit flag (needs_apply = tasks on the phase, or inherit = true on a task). 'ddflow phase lift <id> --need <id> --reason ...' is the one-command audited lift: it removes one edge with a recorded decision, an event and a doctor entry listing active lifts. Existing phases keep their historical behaviour until migrated, with a migration note and a doctor list of phases whose tasks inherit.","dedupe":{"answer":"extends","candidates":[{"id":"D-phase-needs-scope-2026-11-11","score":0.704564369}],"score":0.704564369,"target":"D-phase-needs-scope-2026-11-11"},"extends":"D-phase-needs-scope-2026-11-11","globs":["ddflow/core/graph*.py","ddflow/api/phases*.py"],"item":"","saw":["D-graph-stdlib","D-rename-keeps-alias","D-everything-configurable","D-small-files","D-universal-principles","D-shared-engines-r2","D-ai-import","D-constellation","D-platform-mcp","D-stack-tools","D-acp-r2","D-model-routing","D-company-workflows","D-file-ddflow-defects","D-ddflow-self-assessment-r2","D-unify-r2","D-compat-r2","D-graph-scope-r1","D-no-deletion","D-US-answers","D-no-shell-principle","D-small-files-30k","D-rules-expansion-2026-11","D-external-frontends","D-scale-answers","D-reimpl-answers","Dc8cd2b6d22","D4596ece18d"],"sources":[],"status":"accepted","supersedes":[],"tags":[],"title":"Phase needs scope accepted: phase-level unless a task opts in"},"id":"e58762e6df710d213d9722b5a","kind":"decision.recorded","lamport":175933,"schema":1,"subject":"D-phase-needs-scope-accepted-2026-11-11","ts":"2026-11-11T16:19:23.467824Z"}
